# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 0, translation 1): $$ |\psi\rangle =\alpha|0\rangle+ \beta|1\rangle $$ 
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A qubit's state is represented as a superposition of $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$. An arbitrary quantum state is represented as\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 1, translation 0): ここで $\alpha$ と $\beta$ は $|\alpha|^2+|\beta|^2=1$ を満たす複素数です。
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle =\\alpha|0\\rangle+ \\beta|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are complex numbers such that $|\\alpha|^2+|\\beta|^2=1$.\n"
msgstr "$|0\\rangle$ と $|1\\rangle$ は2次元複素ベクトル空間のベクトルです：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 0, translation 2): $$ |0\rangle = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\0 \end{pmatrix}, |1\rangl
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$ are vectors in the two-dimensional complex vector space:\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 2, translation 0): したがって、任意の量子状態は次のようにも表せます。 
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|0\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"|1\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 0, translation 1): $$ |\psi\rangle = \alpha\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Therefore, an arbitrary quantum state is also represented as\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 1, translation 0): これより、量子ビットの状態とは $|0\rangle$ と $|1\rangle$ を正規直交基底とする2次元複素内積空
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\alpha\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\ 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} + \\beta\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha \\\\ \\beta\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From this, we can see that the state of a quantum bit is a unit vector in a two-dimensional complex inner product space with an orthonormal basis of $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$. It is normalized to 1.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha^* & \\beta^*\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha \\\\\n"
"\\beta\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = 1\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha^* & \\beta^*\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha \\\\\n"
"\\beta\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = 1\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$ |\\psi\\rangle =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha \\\\ \\beta\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}$ は状態ベクトル（statevector）とも呼ばれます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ |\\psi\\rangle =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha \\\\ \\beta\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}$ is also called the statevector.\n"
msgstr "1量子ビットの量子状態は次のようにも表されます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 0, translation 1): $$ |\psi\rangle =\cos\frac{\theta}{2}|0\rangle+e^{i\varphi}\
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A single-qubit quantum state is also represented as\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped (table row count mismatch: source 1, translation 0): ここで $\theta$ と $\varphi$ は次の図のブロッホ球における角度です。 
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"=\\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}|0\\rangle+e^{i\\varphi}\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}|1\\rangle\n"
"=\\left( \\begin{pmatrix} \\cos\\frac{\\theta}{2}\\\\ e^{i\\varphi}\\sin\\frac{\\theta}{2}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $\\theta$ and $\\varphi$ are the angles of the Bloch sphere in the following figure.\n"
msgstr "![ブロッホ球](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/bloch.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Bloch sphere](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/bloch.avif)\n"
"In the next few code cells, we will build up basic calculations from constituent pieces in Qiskit. We'll construct an empty circuit and then add quantum operations, discussing the gates and visualizing their effects as we go.\n"
"You can run the cell by \"Shift\" + \"Enter\". Import the libraries first.\n"
msgstr ""
