# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "X gate {#x-gate}"
msgstr "Xゲート {#x-gate}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The X gate is a $\\pi$ rotation around the $x$ axis of the Bloch sphere.\n"
"Applying the X gate to $|0\\rangle$ results in $|1\\rangle$, and applying the X gate to $|1\\rangle$ results in $|0\\rangle$, so it is an operation similar to the classical NOT gate, and is also known as bit flip. The matrix representation of the X gate is below.\n"
msgstr ""
"Xゲートはブロッホ球の $x$ 軸周りの $\\pi$ 回転です。\n"
"Xゲートを $|0\\rangle$ に適用すると $|1\\rangle$ になり、Xゲートを $|1\\rangle$ に適用すると $|0\\rangle$ になります。これは古典的なNOTゲートと似た演算であり、ビット反転とも呼ばれます。Xゲートの行列表現は以下のとおりです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"X = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/b3468430-0cbc-44ab-bd21-901436662a4b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![前のコードセルの出力](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/b3468430-0cbc-44ab-bd21-901436662a4b-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In IBM Quantum&reg;, the initial state is set to $|0\\rangle$, so the quantum circuit above in matrix representation is\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum&reg; では初期状態が $|0\\rangle$ に設定されているため、上記の量子回路を行列表現で書くと次のようになります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"X|0\\rangle=  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\ 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\ 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = |1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"X|0\\rangle=  \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\ 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 \\\\ 1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix} = |1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

