# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "H gate {#h-gate}"
msgstr "Hゲート {#h-gate}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Hadamard gate is a $\\pi$ rotation around an axis halfway between the $x$ and $z$ axes on the Bloch sphere. Applying the H gate to $|0\\rangle$ creates a superposition state such as $\\frac{|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}$. The matrix representation of the H gate is below.\n"
msgstr "アダマールゲートは、ブロッホ球上の $x$ 軸と $z$ 軸の中間にある軸周りの $\\pi$ 回転です。Hゲートを $|0\\rangle$ に適用すると $\\frac{|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}$ のような重ね合わせ状態が生成されます。Hゲートの行列表現は以下のとおりです。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1 \\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/574c35f0-26a9-423a-8d65-7140ba7398e3-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![前のコードセルの出力](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/574c35f0-26a9-423a-8d65-7140ba7398e3-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/7adf0e93-6db3-4aa8-800f-c91c8cc46001-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![前のコードセルの出力](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/bits-gates-and-circuits/extracted-outputs/7adf0e93-6db3-4aa8-800f-c91c8cc46001-1.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is\n"
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\n"
"0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr "これは次のようになります。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This superposition state is so common and important, that it is given its own symbol:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H|0\\rangle= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 1 \\\\\n"
"1 & -1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
" =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 \\\\\n"
"1\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0.707 \\\\\n"
"0.707\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|0\\rangle+|1\\rangle)\n"
"$$\n"

